ccurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:47:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691205","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5136030-1846018067943777","game_id":"steam-5136030","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.0.1.1310","summary":"AddedAdded an emote panel; you can now select a rat’s emotion by pressing the R key FixedFixed bugs that caused players to be disconnected from the session due to minor network instabilityAdjusted the default settings for sound and music volumeFixed display issues with the combination panel where the description text would overlap the combination number fieldFixed a bug where the value of the previous card combination was displayed on the combination panel when checking if a card is real at the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T11:43:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943777","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5136030-1844751498234078","game_id":"steam-5136030","kind":"announcement","title":"The Drawratos Announcement!","summary":"You are a 🐀 rat. You're playing poker. Every single soul around you is a 🐀 rat, including those you're playing poker with. For cheese.Nobody really makes cards for 🐀 rats, so they have to resort to drawing their own. You have a decent hand, but if you redraw a couple of cards, it would be much better. Nobody is watching you right now anyway, chances are nobody will rat an eye either...Everyone is showing their cards. There are 3 queens of the same suit on the table, and at least 7 tens. The real","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T12:35:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-